==Battleground==
*10 [[Zoge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 17.33~21.33 seconds<sup>520f~640f</sup>.
*3 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 8~12 seconds<sup>240f~360f</sup>.
*4 [[Zang Roo]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 76~78.67 seconds<sup>2,280f~2,360f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Lord Gravey]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Znache]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**5 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
**1 [[Bore]] spawns.

==Strategy==
*Kill the first few Zang Roos with strong attackers, then kill the Bore with strong attackers or [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Reds]] like [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Apple Cat]], [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Hip Hop Cat]], [[Swordsman Cat (Rare Cat)|Swordsman Cat]], [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cat]], [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Fish Cat]], [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] or [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Salon Cat]]. Use any long-ranged attackers to kill Lord Gravey and you should be good.
*Bring an Attack or Defense [[Cat Combo]] if needed.

